WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Crouching light kick intentionally misses before the throw.

2
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.100
The throw precedes the next wake-up low.

3
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.500
The low and two standing jabs connect.

4
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.600
OD Psycho Crusher triggers the mine cinematic.

5
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.050
Forward heavy punch and light Backfist complete the juggle.
